member.summary:
JSON used for every record line and the session manifest. On .NET it defaults to System.Text.Json;
netstandard2.1 hosts (Unity) must supply one (the Unity package uses Newtonsoft, same split as
MindAttic.Capture's ICaptureJson). Serialize camelCase; deserialize case-insensitively.

Entry point for game/app code.  starts a session and makes it ;
most call sites should just use  after that (mirrors MindAttic.Capture's
Capture.Current pattern) rather than threading the session instance through everywhere.
